    <h4>$1,000,000</h4>

    <h3>Verdict - Amerisure No-Fault 18 Years</h3>
    <p>Amerisure paid for no-fault first-party claims for a man injured 18 years before the lawsuit. The insurance company claimed mental problems due to schizophrenia that was unrelated to the accident.</p>
    <h4>$1,000,000</h4>

    <h3>Premises Liability - Black Ice Slip and Fall</h3>
    <p>Settlement for an apartment complex resident in Ann Arbor who was injured when she slipped and fell on black ice on a sidewalk. There was a downspout that drained water into the location of the icy sidewalk which made the location dangerous and effectively unavoidable. The accident victim suffered an ankle fracture.</p>
    <h4>$108,000</h4>

    <h3>Verdict - State Farm Head Injury Denial</h3>
